  "body": [
    "Use Zendesk for EX today with zero code or engineering help required. It works right out of the box, or you can customize with the HR tools in our marketplace—including Okta, LumApps, and more.",
    "Be as helpful to your employees as you are to your customers. Zendesk for work keeps employee requests organized and prioritized, freeing internal teams to focus on big picture tasks.",
    "Support your internal support teams with AI, automations, and workflows—deflecting more tickets and speeding up resolution times.",
    "Zendesk serves internal teams of all stripes. Choose your use case and take a tour—or browse the FAQs for even more information.",
    "Empower your HR team with a support platform that requires zero code or engineering help. Use Zendesk out-of-the-box, or customize with the HR tools in our marketplace—like Okta, Jira, and approval tracking.",
    "With Zendesk, your help desk can access apps, systems, and integrations for change management, asset management, team collaboration and more—all from one central place. In the interactive demo, we’ll guide you through the key components that make up the help desk experience.",
    "Choose the internal support system you need now and add apps from the Zendesk Marketplace as your business expands.",
    "Connect popular apps like Slack and Zoom to reduce system switching.",
    "Gain visibility into asset management with apps like Oomnitza and EZOfficeInventory.",
    "Build custom processes and manage your workflow with apps such as Myndbend and SweetHawk.",
    "Homebridge uses Zendesk to power internal operations",
    "“People kept using it, and kept giving raving, positive reviews—everyone from the account executives, brokers, and the B2B partners that they supported...It was a good fit, so we started bringing in other groups to Zendesk.”",
    "Ben Chapman",
    "Director of Client-Facing Experience and Analytics at Homebridge",
    "4 months",
    "Time to value",
    "23%",
